WEBVTT

00:09:58.246 --> 00:10:02.246
But so right after my mom died,
I was living in Minneapolis.

00:10:02.704 --> 00:10:07.037
I was twenty two and a friend of mine
gave me a gift certificate to see

00:10:07.037 --> 00:10:10.579
an astrologer. And I was like, OK, well,
I don't know,

00:10:10.621 --> 00:10:14.537
like what says astrology stuff, you know?
And but I thought, OK, I'll go.

00:10:14.996 --> 00:10:17.371
And I went and I talked to
this woman, Pat Kaluza,

00:10:17.746 --> 00:10:21.746
and she had this like hippie sort
of place in Minneapolis,

00:10:21.746 --> 00:10:26.371
and she read my birth chart. And
it was astounding and amazing.

00:10:26.371 --> 00:10:30.412
And one of the things she said to me,
she kept going to the father.